{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Embark on a Treacherous Pilgrimage</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide <strong>Mae</strong> on a coming-of-age pilgrimage in this heartfelt precision platformer, designed for both newcomers and those in search of a challenge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474430/extras/8a291a1d76dc0b134d53bb8cd2b09fa8.poster.avif?t=1770941111\" width=780 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474430/extras/8a291a1d76dc0b134d53bb8cd2b09fa8.webm?t=1770941111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For hundreds of years, the Mountain Shaman have used their powers of <strong>Astral Projection</strong> to travel vast distances. But Mae is different \u2013 her spirit travel is limited by a tether. When the time comes for a coming of age pilgrimage, Mae must forgo spirit flight and take the journey the long way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474430/extras/fc4a55ae1cb9ff9972aab27b7bcf5ba2.poster.avif?t=1770941111\" width=780 height=305 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474430/extras/fc4a55ae1cb9ff9972aab27b7bcf5ba2.webm?t=1770941111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Mae on her challenging journey, using tough but satisfying platforming to leap and bound towards her goal. Master seven different <strong>Azae</strong> that change how your spirit interacts with the environment. Scour the world for secrets, treasures and hidden paths \u2013 your curiosity will be rewarded! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision and depth: </strong>Progressively unlock seven different spirit abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seek and find: </strong>Discover hidden secrets, alternate paths and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure precision platforming: </strong>No combat, powerups or skill trees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A speedrunner\u2019s dream: </strong>Push your skills to the limit with timed runs!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tough but forgiving: </strong>Frequent checkpoints help you learn from your mistakes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full of heart: </strong>Discover a story about community, difference and growing up</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474430/extras/a2e9974b0ee864dc9f4b068dcd25898b.avif?t=1770941111\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474430/extras_big/a2e9974b0ee864dc9f4b068dcd25898b.avif?t=1770941111 width=800 height=119 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2474430?t=1770941111","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2474430?t=1770941111","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474430/b6e80546da2996d2c28772eccfd24f09e13d086f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770941111","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2474430/b6e80546da2996d2c28772eccfd24f09e13d086f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770941111","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"desc